    check-wave-script: refuse a contract example that teaches a block class as another class's reason
    
    Detector first (R10-RCA-HARNESS-FRICTION): fails on fix-review.md step 6's
    `blocked <sha> harness: class-open <seam>`, which keys every class-open block
    on harness (#2331, #2353).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/tools/policy/check-wave-script.mjs b/tools/policy/check-wave-script.mjs
